@startuml
!include ../../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/behavioral/state-machine-diagram-style.iuml
title Agent run lifecycle
[*] --> Running
Running --> AwaitingApproval : draft effects
AwaitingApproval --> Running : resume and read decision
Running --> Completed : persist
Completed --> [*]
legend right
  Arrow: transition
  [guard]: condition
endlegend
@enduml
